<report>
<title>Two sample Smirnov test for distribution difference</title>

<p>X sample: <in>x</in><br />
Y sample: <in>y</in></p>

<p>Two sided test:<br />
D = <inu>d</inu><br />
<pval><inp>p</inp></pval></p>

<p>One sided test (suspecting <in>sample_1</in> shifted left of <in>sample_2</in>):<br />
D = <inu>d_l</inu><br />
<pval><inp>p_l</inp></pval></p>

<p>One sided test (suspecting <in>sample_1</in> shifted right of <in>sample_2</in>):<br />
D = <inu>d_r</inu><br />
<pval><inp>p_r</inp></pval></p>
</report>
